Imagegen API includes an adapted image_gen.py CLI and prompting references
from the OpenAI Codex imagegen skill, distributed under Apache License 2.0.
Upstream project: https://github.com/openai/codex

Changes in this distribution: default Flare model; explicit Sunburst support;
model-aware quality and custom-size validation; OPENAI_KEY alias; API-default
skill instructions without repeated key-use confirmation; portable plugin
packaging and inline dependency metadata.

This is an independent extension, not an official OpenAI plugin.
